1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,199
Bro borrowed five hundred bucks and paid back almost two grand.

2
00:00:03,499 --> 00:00:08,735
Scott Tucker ran online payday loans. The fine print said: borrow five hundred, owe six fifty.

3
00:00:08,985 --> 00:00:14,431
But every payday it auto-renewed. He'd take a hundred fifty in fees, and the five hundred? Still sitting there.

4
00:00:14,731 --> 00:00:18,820
One borrower paid nineteen twenty-five total. For a five hundred dollar loan.

5
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:24,396
Four and a half million people. Three and a half billion dollars. And he had his own racing team.

6
00:00:25,296 --> 00:00:30,256
Jury said guilty. All fourteen counts. Sixteen years, eight months.

7
00:00:30,556 --> 00:00:33,099
Be honest, would you have read the fine print? Comment.

8
00:00:33,462 --> 00:00:34,187
Follow.
